                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of State Adee to Minister Bowen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-07-25"><hi rendition="#italic">July 25,
                        1904</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received July 29, 1904.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bowen is directed to advise the Venezuelan Government that if facts are as
                    reported the United States earnestly protests. Further instrcutions will follow
                    to-morrow.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
